# Nothing is excluded. This repository is handed to operators as a complete,
# self-contained folder over GitHub: the seaView installer, the tty0tty
# driver source, the scripts and the config all travel with it, so a clone
# needs no other downloads.
#
# seaview.conf is committed with working defaults and is meant to be edited
# in place on each machine. If you later pull updates, git may report a
# conflict on it -- keep your local version.
